* fixture for tests/test_amiga_bindgen.sh: the MorphOS SDK's rendering of
* muimaster.library -- the same public vectors as the MUI 3.8 kit
* (mui-sfd/muimaster_lib.sfd; the generator cross-checks the two and
* emits the shared functions unguarded), a post-3.8 vector the MUI 5
* SDK's sfd (mui5-sfd) also has (MUI_Show: merged without a platform
* guard, minimum version 20) and a MorphOS-only function at a far
* vector, which gets the :morphos guard.
